{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51269","headline":"普照寺 · 李白","name":"普照寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天台国清寺，天下爲四绝。\n今到普照游，到来复何别。\n柟（一作「枿」）木白云飞，高僧顶残雪。\n门外（一作「前」）一条溪（一作「水」），几回流岁月。\n（《咸淳临安志》八四。\n○苏东坡曰：「予旧在富阳，见国清院太白诗，绝凡近，即此篇也。\n」《渔隐丛话》：「新安水西寺，寺依山背，下瞰长溪。\n太白题诗断句云：『槛外一条溪。\n几回流碎月。\n』今集中无之。\n」王琦按：「《渔隐》所引，即此篇末二句也，盖未睹全篇，故讹以爲《是否水西寺》断句也。\n」。）","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}